# Downloaded CI artifacts (chaos soak / PR-gate evidence) exceed the 5 MB
# commit threshold set by plan 06 Task 2. Only `failures/` subtrees and the
# `chaos-actions.jsonl` of a violating run are committed; node logs never are.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# contents (not the directory) are ignored, directories are re-included so git
# descends into them, and then the wanted files are re-included.
evidence/**
!evidence/**/
!evidence/**/failures/**
# chaos-actions.jsonl only for runs that violated (one line per such run):
!evidence/40674015602/soak/*/chaos-actions.jsonl
# Gate logs of the whole-branch verification (plan 06 Task 6) are evidence of
# record; re-include them over the repository-wide `*.log` ignore.
!branch-logs/*.log
